  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mfenced></math>&nbsp;be a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></math> matrix, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>j</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>otherwise</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br />Let a function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> be defined as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>det</mo><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced></math>. Then the sum of maximum and minimum values of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math>&nbsp;on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> is equal to:",
